<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">Jakoba</book>
  <para style="h">Jakoba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jakoba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jakoba</para>
  <para style="mt">Jakoba</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian leh Lalpa Isua Krista bawih Jakoba hian, hnam sâwm leh hnam hnih khawvêla pêm darhte chu chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka unaute u, fiahna tinrêng in tawh hunin thil lâwmawmah ngai vek rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In rinna fiaha a awm hian tuarchhel in zir a ni tih in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhel taka tuarna hian, tlin lohna laite siam ṭhain mi a tipuitling a, a tifamkim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In zîngah tu pawhin finna a tlâkchham chuan, mi zawng zawng hnêna hau lova phal taka pe ṭhîntu Pathian chu dîl rawh se, pêk a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, rinna neiin, ringhlel hauh lovin dîl rawh se; ringhleltu chu thliin tuifinriat a chhêma a tihfâwn ang hi a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutiang mi rilru mumal lo, a thiltih eng maha nghet lo chuan Lalpa hnên ata eng mah hmuh inring suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unau rethei tak chu chawisâna a awmin lâwm sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hausa pawh tihtlâwma a awmin lâwm bawk rawh se, hnim pâr angin a hausakna chu a ral mai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni a lo chhuak a, thli lum a lo tlehin hnim chu a tivuai a, a pâr chu a tla a, a mawina a lo chuai ṭhîn. Chutiangin mi hausa pawh a sum buaipui chungin a boral dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fiahna tâwka ding nghet tlat chu a nihlawh e, fiaha a awm hnuin Lalpan amah hmangaihtute pêk a tiam, chawimawina lukhum, nunna chu, a chang dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu man thlêmna an tawhin, “Pathianin min thlêm alâwm maw le,” ti suh se. Pathian chu sual tûra thlêm rual a ni lo, amah lahin mi a thlêm ngai bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi tin hi mahni châkna suala thlêm an ni ṭheuh zâwk a, chu chuan a hîpin a hruai bo ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu châkna chuan no a pai a, sual a hring a, a lo puitlin chuan thihna a hring ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka unau duh takte u, bumin awm suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thilpêk ṭha tinrêng leh thilpêk famkim tawh phawt chu chung lam aṭanga lo kal, êng siamtu Pa hnên ata lo chhuak a ni. Amah chu a danglam ngai lo va, inher danglamin vânglai leh mang lai a nei lo va, thimah min awmtîr ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thilsiamte zînga rah hmasa atân ama duh ang takin thutakah min hring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka unau duh takte u, hêng hi hre rawh u. Mi tinin ngaihthlâk lam uar sela, sawi lam chuh lovin dawh thei rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mihring thinurna hi Pathian felna tihlanna kawng a ni si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chuvângin, thil tenawm chi tin leh sual tinrêng paih bo ula, in thinlunga Pathian thu tuh, chhandam thei che u chu, thuhnuairawlh takin pawm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thil tih awm si lova thu ngaihthlâk ngawt tâwka ngaiin mahni inbum hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh thu ngaithlatu ni-a zâwm si lo chu, darthlalanga mahni hmêl entu ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ngun takin a inen a, a kal sawn hnu chuan eng ang hmêl pu nge a nih a theihnghilh leh mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, tu pawh dân famkim, min tizalêntu chu bih nguna, chutianga awm renga, ngaithlaa, theihnghilh leh mai lova, a zawma zâwmtu ngei chu a thiltih apiangah a hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu pawh sakhaw mi tak nia inngaia, a lei vêng hneh si lo chu mahni inbum a ni a, a sakhua chu engmahlo mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kan Pa Pathian mit hmuha sakhaw biak dân thianghlim leh sual tel lo chu hei hi a ni: fahrah leh hmeithaite an hrehawm laia kana, khawvêl bawlhhlawh kai lova invawn ṭhat hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute u, kan Lalpa ropui tak Isua Krista ringtute chuan hleih nei suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In sunagog-ah mi rangkachak zungbun buna kawr ṭha tak ha lo lût sela, mi rethei kawr chhe tak ha lo lût bawk sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kawr ṭha ha chu in lo ngaihsaka, “Nang chu ṭhutna ṭhaah hian ṭhu rawh,” in tiha, mi rethei hnênah chuan, “Nang chu saw tah sâwn ding rawh,” emaw, “Ka ke bul chhuatah hian ṭhu rawh,” emaw in tih si chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hleih in nei a, in thlîr dân rilru a sual hle a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka unau duh takte u, ngaithla teh u, khawvêl ngaiha mi retheite hi rinnaa hausa tûr leh, amah hmangaihtute hnêna a ram tiam chang atân Pathianin a thlang lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangni zawngin mi retheite chu in zah lo va. Mi hausate hi nangmahni hnehchhiahtute leh rorêlna ina hnûk lût ṭhîntu che u an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hming duhawm tak in put chu sawichhetute an ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nangmah i inhmangaih angin i vêngte i hmangaih tûr a ni,” tih Lehkha Thua chuang Dân ropui ber hi in zawm chuan in ti ṭha e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hleih in neih erawh chuan thil sual in ti a ni e, Dân bawhchhetute in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu pawhin Dân zâwm vek mah se, pakhat pawh a bawhchhiat si chuan a zavaia bawhchhia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Uire suh,” titu chuan, “Tual that suh,” a ti bawk si a; uire lo mah la, tual i thah si chuan Dân bawhchhia i ni tho mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Dân, min zalêntîrtu hmanga rêlsak tûr kan ni tih inhriain thu sawi ula, thil ti bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawngaihna tel lova thil titu chu khawngaihna tel lova rêlsak a ni ang, mi khawngaih thei erawh chuan rorêlna hlauh tûr a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka unaute u, miin, “Rinna ka nei,” ti sela, a thiltihah tilang si lo sela, eng nge a sâwtna? Chutiang rinna chuan a chhandam thei ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Unaupa emaw, farnu emaw saruak leh rilṭâmin awm sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />in zînga tuin emaw, “Thlamuang takin kal ta la lum tak leh puar takin awm ang che,” ti sela, a taksa tâna mamawh chu a pêk si loh chuan eng nge a sâwtna?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin thil tih tel lova rinna chauh hi chuan awmzia a nei lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“A ṭhenin an ring a, a ṭhenin thil an ti a ni mai alâwm,” tia ṭang an awm thei e. A nih leh, thil tiha tilang si lova rinna i neih theih dân min entîr ta che, keiin rinna ka nei tih ka thiltihin ka entîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian pakhat chauh a awm tih i ring maw? I ti ṭha e, ramhuaite pawhin chu chu an ring a, an khûr ṭhîn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi â pa, rinna hi thiltih tel lo chuan eng mah a ni lo tih i hre duh maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Min thlahtu Abrahama kha a fapa Isaka, maichâma a hlan lai khân, a thiltih avânga thiam chantîr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A rinna leh a thiltih chu a ṭang kawp a, a thiltih chuan a rinna chu a tifamkim ta tih i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lehkha Thu, “Abrahaman Pathian a ring a, a rin avâng chuan thiam changah pawm a ni ta,” tih chu a thleng a, Pathian ṭhiana vuah a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Miin thiltih avângin thiam an chang a, rinna avâng chauh chuan a ni lo tih in hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutiang chuan Rahabi, nawhchizuar pawh khân, mi tirhte chu a lo lâwm a, kawng dangah a hâwntîr a, a thiltih avâng khân thiam a chang a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Taksa hi thlarau tel lo chuan thi a ni angin, thil tih tel lo chuan rinna pawh hi thi a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka unaute u, zirtîrtu nih tum vek kher suh u, zirtîrtute hi mi dangte aia khirh zâwka rorêlsak kan la ni dâwn tih in hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan za-in thil tam tak kan tisual fo ṭhîn. Tu pawh a thu sawia tisual ngai lo mi chu mi puitling a ni a, chutiang mi chuan an taksa pum pawh an thunun thei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan thu awihtîr tûrin sakawr kâah thîrbarh kan barh a, an taksa pum pawh kan duhnaah kan hertîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lawngte pawh lian hle mah se, thli na takin a chhêm kal lai pawhin a khalhtuin a duhna lam lamah a tihherna tê tak têin a kaltîr thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin lei pawh hi taksa pêng tê tak tê a ni na a, uang thei tak a ni. Mei si tê tak têin ramngaw zau pui a tikâng te hi ngaihtuah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei pawh hi mei ang a ni a, khawlohna tinrênga khat, kan taksaa tel, kan taksa nun tibawlhhlawhtu a ni a, kan khawsak dân zawng zawng hremhmun meia tihrehawmtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ramsa leh sava tinrêng te, rannung leh sangha tinrêng te hi khawi ngam theih an ni a, mihringin an khawi ngam bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei erawh hi chu tu man an khawi ngam thei lo, khuahkhirh theih loh sual, thihna tûra khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chuan kan Pa, Lalpa chu kan fak a, kan mihringpui, Pathian anpuia siamte ânchhia kan lawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kâ pakhat aṭangin fakna leh ânchhia a chhuak ṭhîn. Ka unaute u, chutiang tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tui hna pakhat aṭangin tui tui leh tui lo a chhuak ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute u, theipui kûngah oliv a rah ngai em ni? Grep hruiah pawh theipui a rah thei em ni? Chi khur aṭangin zo tui thiang a lo chhuak thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In zîngah finna leh hriatthiamna nei an awm em? Chêt dân mawi leh thil ṭha tihin thiam tak leh thuhnuairawlh takin lantîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In thinlungah îtsîkna thûk tak leh mahni hmasialna in neih rûk si chuan, thu dik kalha in finna uanpuiin dâwt sawi suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang finna chu chung lam aṭanga chhuak a ni lo va, ramhuai laka chhuak a ni zâwk, a khawvêl a, a thlarau lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Îtsîkna leh mahni hmasialna awmnaah chuan buaina leh sualna chi tinrêng a awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chung lam aṭanga finna lo chhuak chu a hmasa berah a thianghlim a, a dawtah a nêlawm a, a nunnêm a, a tihnuam bawk a; khawngaihnain a khat a, rah ṭha a chhuah ṭhîn; hleih a nei lo va, a vervêk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Remna siamtuten remna zawnga chi an tuh chu thil ṭhain a rah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />In zînga indona leh insualna te hi khawi aṭanga lo chhuak nge ni? Nawmchen in duhna, in thinlung chhûnga indona thlen ṭhîntu aṭangin a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In awt a, in nei si lo; tual in thah phah a; in ît a, in nei thei bawk si lo, in inhauvin in insual phah a; Pathian hnênah in thlen loh avângin in duhzâwng chu in nei lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />in dîl pawhin in dîl dân a dik loh avângin in hmu lo, nuamtâwl nân hman in tum si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Uirete u, khawvêl ṭhian nih hi Pathian hmêlma nihna a ni tih in hre lo vem ni? Khawvêl ṭhian nih duh apiang chu Pathian hmêlmaah a insiam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lehkha Thu-in, “Keimahnia a thlarau a dah hian min duh hliah hliah zia a entîr a ni,” a tih hi a sawi satliah mai niin in ring em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawngaihna min vûr tam zâwk mah lehnghâl asin. Chuvângin, “Pathianin chapote a dodâl a, Inngaitlâwmte erawh chu a khawngaih ṭhîn,” tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Pathian hnênah intulût ula, Diabola erawh chu dodâl rawh u; tichuan, a tlânsan ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian hnaih rawh u, ani pawhin a hnaih ang che u. Mi sualte u, in kutte sil fai ula, mi vervêkte u, in thinlung tithianghlim rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangang ula, lungngai ula, ṭap rawh u; in nuih lungngaihah chang sela, in hlim nguiah chang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan inngaitlâwm ula; tichuan, a chawisâng ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute u, insawichhe tawn suh u. Tu pawh a unau sawichhia emaw, dem emaw chuan Dân a sawichhia a, Dân a dem a ni; Dân i dem chuan, Dân zâwmtu i ni lo va, rorêltu i ni zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dân petu leh rorêltu pakhat chauh a awm - chhandam theia tiboral theitu chu; nang, ṭhenawmte dem veitu chu tu nge maw i nih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngaithla teh u, nangni, “Vawiinah nge, naktûkah nge ni ang, khawii khuaah emaw kan kal ang a, chutah chuan kum khat kan va sumdâwng ang a, kan hlêp ṭeuh mai ang,” titute u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />naktûkah in nunna chu eng angin nge a awm dâwn tih pawh in hre si lo. Chhûm, rei lo tê lo langa, ral leh ta mai ang lek hi in ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Lalpan rem a tih chuan kan dam ang a, chumi khami chu kan ti ang,” in ti zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah zawng chapo takin in uang a. Chutianga chapo taka awm chu sual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, thil ṭha tih tûr hriaa ti si lo chu a sual a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangni mi hausate u, ngaithla teh u, in chunga hrehawm lo thleng tûr avâng hian ṭap ula, chiau vawng vawng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In hausaknate a chhe zo ta a, in puante pawh thîmin a ei zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In rangkachak leh tangka pawh a lo tuiêk zo va, a tuiêk chu in thiam lohzia lantîrtu a ni ang a, meiin thil a kâng ral angin in tisa chu a ei zo vang. Ni hnuhnûngah hian ro in khâwlkhâwm a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in lova thawktute hlawh in hrênsakte chu an au va, buh sengtute au thâwm chu Engkim Lalpa beng a thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leiah hian nuamsa tak leh nuamtâwlin in awm a, inthah rûnpui ni atâna inchâwm thau mai in nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi Diktaka chu thiam loh in chantîr a, in that a, ani chuan a dodâl loh che u kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, unaute u, Lalpa lo kal hma zawng chhel takin awm rawh u. Lo neituin a lo aṭanga rah seng tûr a nghah dân hi en rawh u; ruah hmasa leh ruah hnuhnûng a nghâk fan fan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni pawh chhel takin awm ula, rilru nghet tak pu rawh u; Lalpa lo kal lehna a hnai tawh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Unaute u, thiam loh changa in awm loh nân innghirngho suh u. Ngai teh u, rorêltu chu kawngka bulah a awm reng tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Unaute u, Lalpa hminga thu sawitu zâwlneiten tihduhdahna chhel taka an tuar dân kha entawn atân hmang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhel taka tuartu chu nihlawh kan ti a ni. Joba tuarchhelzia in hria a, Lalpan a tâwpa a tih dân kha in hria e. Lalpa chu zahngaihna leh khawngaihnain a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka unaute u, eng pawh ni se, chhia zawng chham suh u, vân emaw, lei emaw, thil dang chhâlin emaw chhia chham suh u, ‘ni’ in tih chu ‘ni’ ti mai ula, ‘ni lo’ in tih chu ‘ni lo’ ni mai rawh se; chutichuan, thiam lohvin in awm dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />In zîngah vânduaina tâwk an awm em? Ṭawngṭai rawh se. Hlim an awm em? Fak hla sa rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />In zîngah damlo an awm em? Kohhran upa kohtîr sela, annin Lalpa hminga hriak hnawihin a tân ṭawngṭai rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ring tlata ṭawngṭaina chuan damlo chu a tidam ang a, Lalpan a kaitho vang; thil a lo tihsual tawh pawh ngaihdam a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, in sualte thupha chawi tawn ula, inṭawngṭaisak rawh u; tichuan, tihdamin in awm dâwn nia. Ṭhahnemngai taka mi dik ṭawngṭaina chuan thil ropui tak a thawk thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Elija chu keimahni anga mihring ve mai bawk a ni a, ruah sûr loh nân ṭhahnemngai takin a ṭawngṭai a, kum thum leh thla ruk chhûng lei chungah ruah a sûr ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ṭawngṭai leh a, vân ata ruah a lo sûr a, lei aṭangin thlaite a lo thar leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka unaute u, in zînga tu emaw thutak aṭangin pêng bo sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />mi sual, a kawng bona ata hruai kîr lehtu chuan thihna ata a thlarau a chhandam ang a, sual tam tak a khuh bosak bawk ang tih hre rawh u.
  </para>
</usx>
